# Datasets: rebuild with `python src/ingest.py [--dataset midv2019]` rather than
# committing ~570MB of JPEG. data/ is ignored wholesale so a third dataset added
# later cannot slip into a commit the way data/midv2019/ nearly did.
data/
*.zip

# Cached ResNet50 embeddings: regenerate with `python src/features.py` (~20 min)
models/*.npz

# Note: models/head_*.pt are deliberately NOT ignored. Each is 26 KB, and committing
# them lets anyone clone the repo and run predict.py without rebuilding the dataset.

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
